    {
      "id": "note-1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 152,
      "y": 1056,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 19,
      "angle": 0,
      "autoResize": true,
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "boundElements": null,
      "containerId": null,
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "fontSize": 15,
      "frameId": null,
      "groupIds": [],
      "index": "a62",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "opacity": 100,
      "originalText": "• Two entry points, one pipeline: ⭐ is automatic and covers a whole discography; Request is manual and surgical.",
      "roughness": 1,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1109512761,
      "strokeColor": "#343a40",
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "text": "• Two entry points, one pipeline: ⭐ is automatic and covers a whole discography; Request is manual and surgical.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "updated": 1787717104529,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1111508379,
      "verticalAlign": "middle"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 152,
      "y": 1086,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 19,
      "angle": 0,
      "autoResize": true,
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "boundElements": null,
      "containerId": null,
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "fontSize": 15,
      "frameId": null,
      "groupIds": [],
      "index": "a63",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "opacity": 100,
      "originalText": "• ImportListSync carries definitionId — that is what bypasses CustomImport's 6-hour MinRefreshInterval.",
      "roughness": 1,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2020802,
      "strokeColor": "#343a40",
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "text": "• ImportListSync carries definitionId — that is what bypasses CustomImport's 6-hour MinRefreshInterval.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "updated": 1787717104529,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 798359566,
      "verticalAlign": "middle"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 152,
      "y": 1116,
      "width": 1250,
      "height": 19,
      "angle": 0,
      "autoResize": true,
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "boundElements": null,
      "containerId": null,
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "fontSize": 15,
      "frameId": null,
      "groupIds": [],
      "index": "a64",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "opacity": 100,
      "originalText": "• Lidarr's own 'missing' count is useless here: it only sees its own root folder, so an 11-album FLAC collection stored elsewhere reads as entirely absent.",
      "roughness": 1,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1811377433,
      "strokeColor": "#343a40",
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "text": "• Lidarr's own 'missing' count is useless here: it only sees its own root folder, so an 11-album FLAC collection stored elsewhere reads as entirely absent.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "updated": 1787717104529,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 989197301,
      "verticalAlign": "middle"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 152,
      "y": 1146,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 19,
      "angle": 0,
      "autoResize": true,
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "boundElements": null,
      "containerId": null,
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "fontSize": 15,
      "frameId": null,
      "groupIds": [],
      "index": "a65",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "opacity": 100,
      "originalText": "• The loop closes with no human in it. Nothing needs to be moved, renamed or rescanned.",
      "roughness": 1,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2035294662,
      "strokeColor": "#343a40",
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
